(USER MANUAL) Tj T*
(AI Audio Mixing & Mastering Analyzer) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Overview) Tj T*
(-----------) Tj T*
(This standalone Windows-oriented Python desktop application analyzes finished mixes, masters) Tj T*
(, stems and reference material without modifying source audio. It produces measurements, war) Tj T*
(nings and AI-ready evidence for mixing and mastering decisions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The application is an analyzer and decision-support tool. It does not automatically change a) Tj T*
(udio, apply EQ, compress files, or replace critical listening.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Installation) Tj T*
(---------------) Tj T*
(Install Python 3.10 or newer. Open a terminal in the application folder and run:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(pip install -r requirements.txt) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Start the program with:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(python main.py) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Required packages include NumPy, SciPy, SoundFile, Matplotlib and Pytest.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Uploading files) Tj T*
(------------------) Tj T*
(Click UPLOAD FILES and select one or more WAV, AIFF, FLAC, OGG or MP3 files supported by the) Tj T*
( installed SoundFile backend. Original files are read only.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Uploaded files appear in the file list. Select a file after analysis to inspect its individu) Tj T*
(al results.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Running analysis) Tj T*
(-------------------) Tj T*
(Click ANALYZE ALL. Files are processed in the background so the interface remains responsive) Tj T*
(. The progress bar shows batch progress.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(If a file cannot be decoded, its error is recorded while other files continue.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Reading results) Tj T*
(------------------) Tj T*
(MIX SCORE is an explainable screening score, not an artistic quality rating. LUFS indicates ) Tj T*
(integrated loudness. TRUE PEAK estimates inter-sample peak level. RMS describes average sign) Tj T*
(al energy. CORRELATION indicates left/right similarity and possible mono compatibility risk.) Tj T*
( CLIPS reports samples at or above digital full scale.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The right-hand AI-READY FINDINGS panel lists severity, measured evidence, what to check and ) Tj T*
(confidence.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. AI BRIEF export) Tj T*
(------------------) Tj T*
(Click AI BRIEF to export a JSON package containing every analyzed file, measurements, findin) Tj T*
(gs, target loudness and instructions for an AI assistant. Upload this JSON to an AI system a) Tj T*
(nd ask it to prioritize mix decisions using evidence only.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. Recommended workflow) Tj T*
(-----------------------) Tj T*
(Analyze the mix before and after each major revision. Compare LUFS and true peak at matched ) Tj T*
(playback levels. Investigate warnings in the DAW with solo, spectrum, correlation and mono c) Tj T*
(hecks. Make small changes, export a new version, and re-analyze.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
