(TECHNICAL REFERENCE) Tj T*
(AI Audio Mixing & Mastering Analyzer) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Processing architecture) Tj T*
(--------------------------) Tj T*
(The interface is implemented in Tkinter. Analysis runs in a worker thread and communicates p) Tj T*
(rogress back to the GUI. DSP is separated into analyzer modules; AI interpretation and repor) Tj T*
(ting are separate modules.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Main pipeline: audio_loader -> loudness, true_peak, spectrum, stereo, quality -> interpreter) Tj T*
( -> JSON/CSV/AI brief.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Audio loading) Tj T*
(----------------) Tj T*
(audio_loader.py uses SoundFile to decode supported formats and converts samples to float32 w) Tj T*
(ithout normalization. Metadata includes filename, duration, sample rate, channel count and s) Tj T*
(ource subtype. Source files are never overwritten.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Loudness) Tj T*
(-----------) Tj T*
(loudness.py applies high-pass and high-shelf K-weighting approximations, creates overlapping) Tj T*
( loudness windows, records loudness history and calculates integrated, momentary, short-term) Tj T*
( and LRA-style values.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(For mastering release decisions, validate results against a trusted BS.1770/EBU R128 meter b) Tj T*
(ecause this foundation is an approximation and should not yet be treated as a certified comp) Tj T*
(liance meter.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. True peak) Tj T*
(------------) Tj T*
(true_peak.py uses SciPy resample_poly oversampling, currently at 4x, and reports the maximum) Tj T*
( reconstructed sample level in dBTP plus its approximate source position.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Spectrum) Tj T*
(-----------) Tj T*
(spectrum.py computes a Hann-windowed real FFT, reports frequency bins, magnitude, centroid, ) Tj T*
(bandwidth and energy in seven bands: sub-bass, bass, low-mid, mid, upper-mid, presence and h) Tj T*
(igh.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Stereo and phase) Tj T*
(-------------------) Tj T*
(stereo.py calculates left/right RMS, Mid and Side RMS, width ratio and inter-channel correla) Tj T*
(tion. Negative correlation is flagged as a potential phase/mono compatibility issue. It is a) Tj T*
( diagnostic indicator, not proof of an audible defect.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. Quality checks) Tj T*
(-----------------) Tj T*
(quality.py reports sample peak, clipped sample count and timestamps, per-channel DC offset, ) Tj T*
(RMS and crest factor. Timestamp lists are capped at the first 100 events to keep reports man) Tj T*
(ageable.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8. AI safety model) Tj T*
(------------------) Tj T*
(interpreter.py produces structured findings with problem, evidence, severity, explanation, s) Tj T*
(uggested checks and confidence. It must not invent measurements. Frequency and stereo findin) Tj T*
(gs are phrased as possible issues requiring listening and engineering verification.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(9. Export schema) Tj T*
(----------------) Tj T*
(Per-file JSON contains file metadata plus loudness, true_peak, spectrum, stereo and quality ) Tj T*
(objects. The AI brief wraps these results with recommendations and explicit instructions to ) Tj T*
(use supplied measurements only. CSV export flattens scalar measurements into metric/value ro) Tj T*
(ws.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(10. Current limitations) Tj T*
(-----------------------) Tj T*
(This version does not yet provide certified loudness compliance, full multichannel BS.1770 c) Tj T*
(hannel weighting, true drag-and-drop, PDF/PNG report generation inside the app, interactive ) Tj T*
(charts, reference-track comparison, goniometer rendering, or an embedded cloud AI connection) Tj T*
(. These are appropriate next development milestones.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
